# GitHub gets only the overlay, the README and the LICENSE.
# Everything else stays on this PC: tools/ (build tools and local data; tools/_work holds the DanOverlay
# extraction output from the user's DanOverlay.exe — do not publish), engine/ (the Python reference engine),
# install_overlay.bat, .claude/ and .coverage.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/overlay/
/overlay/*
!/overlay/total_maniaset/
/overlay/total_maniaset/data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.zip
